# Dependencies and build artifacts must be produced inside the image, never
# copied from the host. In particular, letting the host's frontend/node_modules
# overlay the container's install makes pnpm's verify-deps-before-run try to
# reinstall (and abort with no TTY) during `pnpm run build`.
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/coverage

# VCS and local-only tooling / artifacts
.git
.github
graphify-out
.mcp.json
**/*.log
